{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 2, "text": "义。“勒尤”也常常作为定情的信物，赠给女方。", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 241, "w": 840, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "义。“勒尤”也常常作为定情的信物，赠给女方。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 241, "w": 840, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 3, "text": "姊妹箫。是一种吹奏乐器。由于吹奏时，一种是两人各吹奏一支同音高的箫，一种", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 310, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "姊妹箫。是一种吹奏乐器。由于吹奏时，一种是两人各吹奏一支同音高的箫，一种", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 310, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 4, "text": "是一人吹奏两支并在一起的同音高的箫，因而得此名。它是两支很短而有哨子的竹箫，", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 374, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "是一人吹奏两支并在一起的同音高的箫，因而得此名。它是两支很短而有哨子的竹箫，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 374, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 5, "text": "有四个或五个音，一支的音调比另一支高，吹奏时自然形成高低声部。它是独奏乐器，也", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 439, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有四个或五个音，一支的音调比另一支高，吹奏时自然形成高低声部。它是独奏乐器，也", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 439, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 6, "text": "是小歌的伴奏乐器。形状类似一般的箫，水竹制成，长20厘米左右。顶端封口。在靠近顶", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 503, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "是小歌的伴奏乐器。形状类似一般的箫，水竹制成，长20厘米左右。顶端封口。在靠近顶", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 503, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 7, "text": "端处有一方舌形簧片。布依族姊妹箫称“力勒歪练”，有八个孔，前七后一，可用于独奏或伴", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 567, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "端处有一方舌形簧片。布依族姊妹箫称“力勒歪练”，有八个孔，前七后一，可用于独奏或伴", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 567, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 8, "text": "奏。", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 636, "w": 64, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "奏。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 636, "w": 64, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 9, "text": "箫筒。是用竹子做成的一种直吹乐器，在布依族地区广为流传。箫筒是由一段30", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 696, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "箫筒。是用竹子做成的一种直吹乐器，在布依族地区广为流传。箫筒是由一段30", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 696, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 10, "text": "厘米左右的竹子做成，竹子一端留一个竹节，在有竹节的一侧用小刀削一斜口。杆身上", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 764, "w": 1544, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "厘米左右的竹子做成，竹子一端留一个竹节，在有竹节的一侧用小刀削一斜口。杆身上", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 764, "w": 1544, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 11, "text": "开有五个发音孔。箫筒的音色，介于勒尤与勒浪之间。既不像勒尤那么浑厚，也不像勒", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 829, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "开有五个发音孔。箫筒的音色，介于勒尤与勒浪之间。既不像勒尤那么浑厚，也不像勒", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 829, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 12, "text": "浪那么清脆。", "bbox_px": {"x": 128, "y": 887, "w": 234, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "浪那么清脆。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 128, "y": 887, "w": 234, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 13, "text": "月琴。在制作上与其他民族相似，但在定弦和演奏方面有着自己的民族特色。布依", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 954, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "月琴。在制作上与其他民族相似，但在定弦和演奏方面有着自己的民族特色。布依", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 954, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 14, "text": "族人民当中流传的月琴，多九个品位。琴面上有三根弦，里弦一根，外弦两根系同一音", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1022, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "族人民当中流传的月琴，多九个品位。琴面上有三根弦，里弦一根，外弦两根系同一音", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1022, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 15, "text": "高。月琴演奏者在演奏时，基本上只弹外弦。由于弹奏乐曲每一拍的第一个音时，都善", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1086, "w": 1540, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "高。月琴演奏者在演奏时，基本上只弹外弦。由于弹奏乐曲每一拍的第一个音时，都善", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1086, "w": 1540, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 16, "text": "于弹响内弦的空弦音，因而“2”成了乐曲中的固定低音，使乐曲每一拍的第一个音出现了", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1147, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "于弹响内弦的空弦音，因而“2”成了乐曲中的固定低音，使乐曲每一拍的第一个音出现了", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1147, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 17, "text": "各种音程的和音。", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1215, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "各种音程的和音。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1215, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 18, "text": "四弦胡。主要流行于黔西南布依族苗族自治州境内，它的基本构造与流行在各族人", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1275, "w": 1463, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "四弦胡。主要流行于黔西南布依族苗族自治州境内，它的基本构造与流行在各族人", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1275, "w": 1463, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 19, "text": "民中的胡琴相似。所不同的是：琴颈上有四个弦轴，里外都张有两根同一音高的弦。由", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1344, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "民中的胡琴相似。所不同的是：琴颈上有四个弦轴，里外都张有两根同一音高的弦。由", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1344, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 20, "text": "于里外比其他胡琴各多了一根弦，因此音量相对地也要响亮些。", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1412, "w": 1102, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "于里外比其他胡琴各多了一根弦，因此音量相对地也要响亮些。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1412, "w": 1102, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 21, "text": "葫芦琴。葫芦琴在制作与构造方面，与其他胡琴基本相同。它的特点在于共鸣筒是", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1473, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "葫芦琴。葫芦琴在制作与构造方面，与其他胡琴基本相同。它的特点在于共鸣筒是", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1473, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 22, "text": "用葫芦瓜做成的。葫芦琴的音色圆润，它是布依戏、八音坐弹戏伴奏的主要乐器之一。", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1541, "w": 1496, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "用葫芦瓜做成的。葫芦琴的音色圆润，它是布依戏、八音坐弹戏伴奏的主要乐器之一。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1541, "w": 1496, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 23, "text": "笔管。主要流行于贵州省黔南布依族苗族自治州荔波地区，是布依族独有的单簧气", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1605, "w": 1463, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "笔管。主要流行于贵州省黔南布依族苗族自治州荔波地区，是布依族独有的单簧气", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1605, "w": 1463, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 24, "text": "鸣乐器。由管身和共鸣筒构成，管身水竹，共鸣筒由半截葫芦制成，呈喇叭形。因其外", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1670, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "鸣乐器。由管身和共鸣筒构成，管身水竹，共鸣筒由半截葫芦制成，呈喇叭形。因其外", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1670, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 25, "text": "形细长与毛笔的管子相似而得名。布依语称勒拱。已有200年的历史，后来曾有音乐工", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1734, "w": 1548, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "形细长与毛笔的管子相似而得名。布依语称勒拱。已有200年的历史，后来曾有音乐工", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1734, "w": 1548, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 26, "text": "作者对其进行改革，取得良好成效。", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1794, "w": 623, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "作者对其进行改革，取得良好成效。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1794, "w": 623, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 27, "text": "铜鼓。布依族的古老乐器。是传说中布杰用生命换回来用以超度亡灵的器物，可作", "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1863, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "铜鼓。布依族的古老乐器。是传说中布杰用生命换回来用以超度亡灵的器物，可作", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 213, "y": 1863, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 28, "text": "乐器、礼器、炊具等。布依族使用的铜鼓大多数属于“麻江型”铜鼓，用青铜以泥范法铸造", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1923, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "乐器、礼器、炊具等。布依族使用的铜鼓大多数属于“麻江型”铜鼓，用青铜以泥范法铸造", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1923, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 29, "text": "而成，呈圆墩形，鼓身以花纹装饰，鼓面一般有浮雕图案，分布有太阳纹及晕圈，庄重而威", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1992, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "而成，呈圆墩形，鼓身以花纹装饰，鼓面一般有浮雕图案，分布有太阳纹及晕圈，庄重而威", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 1992, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 375, "line_no": 30, "text": "严。铸成后一般先经由专门的鼓师调音后再行使用，常与唢呐、皮鼓、大镲、铙钹、锣木棍", "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 2056, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "严。铸成后一般先经由专门的鼓师调音后再行使用，常与唢呐、皮鼓、大镲、铙钹、锣木棍", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 133, "y": 2056, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
